WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:07.207
Vroom!

2
00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:11.354
The Astro bikes shot through the woods.

3
00:00:11.355 --> 00:00:17.992
The woods grew dark.

4
00:00:17.993 --> 00:00:29.253
"Stop!" Lucy cried. "The footprints end here!"

5
00:00:29.254 --> 00:00:31.977
"You're right," Ringo said.

6
00:00:31.978 --> 00:00:35.322
"Let's look for the hikers here."

7
00:00:35.323 --> 00:00:39.470
Everyone started checking the woods.

8
00:00:39.471 --> 00:00:43.060
Ringo looked high and low.

9
00:00:43.061 --> 00:00:46.321
Bot looked left and right.

10
00:00:46.322 --> 00:00:49.882
PJ looked all around.

11
00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:53.380
Lucy looked for a while.

12
00:00:53.381 --> 00:00:57.321
Then she sat on a big tree root.

13
00:00:57.322 --> 00:01:00.198
She pulled out the trail map.

14
00:01:00.199 --> 00:01:03.092
"Ugh!" Lucy thought.

15
00:01:03.093 --> 00:01:06.259
"This trail is so long.

16
00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:10.157
It will take forever to find these hikers!"

17
00:01:10.158 --> 00:01:13.409
Suddenly the root wiggled.

18
00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.628
"Huh?" Lucy said.

19
00:01:15.629 --> 00:01:17.027
She stood up.

20
00:01:17.028 --> 00:01:19.865
The root wiggled again.

21
00:01:19.866 --> 00:01:22.748
Several trees began to move.

22
00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:25.269
Lucy looked up and gasped.

23
00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.371
"Those aren't trees.

24
00:01:27.372 --> 00:01:33.398
They're spider legs!"

25
00:01:33.399 --> 00:01:36.418
Lucy ran through the woods.

26
00:01:36.419 --> 00:01:40.503
The spider followed her.

27
00:01:40.504 --> 00:01:46.070
They went deep into the woods.

28
00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:48.779
"Oh no!" Lucy thought.

29
00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.576
She was blocked by a wall of trees!

30
00:01:51.577 --> 00:01:54.064
She stopped and spun around.

31
00:01:54.065 --> 00:01:57.271
The spider was right behind her!

32
00:01:57.272 --> 00:02:00.127
It had huge red eyes.

33
00:02:00.128 --> 00:02:03.882
Lucy felt dizzy looking into them.

34
00:02:03.883 --> 00:02:11.868
Then everything went black.

